      "statement": "The purchase flow follows a complete sequence: browser fetches catalog, adds to cart, calls payments.createOrder, Ulabase creates Stripe session, browser redirects to Stripe, Stripe redirects back to success URL, Orders page polls waitForOrder, webhook updates order status, and UI shows paid.",
